{"articles":[{"no":"第一點","path":[],"text":"雲林縣政府為審慎處理違反建築法（以下簡稱本法）使用管理規定事件，並兼顧裁罰之明確性、適當性與公平性及符合比例原則，以減少裁罰爭議及提升行政效率，特訂定本基準。","id":"雲林縣-GL001115/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"f7e0fdf3b62029f7ede5c9350a3d8462ad83f592e0c36c786cdb10d0384d7473","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二點","path":[],"text":"違反本法使用管理規定事件裁罰基準如附表。但案件情節特殊，有加重或減輕之必要者，得敘明加重或減輕之理由，於法定罰鍰額度內，加重或減輕處罰。","id":"雲林縣-GL001115/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"2401ba7d45fcaffbd3c3d545b23190d2e0bfbf974e2c73a90a37f4ab140494c0","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"雲林縣政府處理違反建築法事件裁罰基準.pdf","url":"https://law.yunlin.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=66941&id=GL001115&type=LAW"},{"title":"附表-雲林縣政府處理違反建築法事件裁罰基準.pdf","url":"https://law.yunlin.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=66458&id=GL001115&type=LAW"}],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"雲林縣-GL001115","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"民國 113 年 09 月 06 日","name":"雲林縣政府處理違反建築法事件裁罰基準","region":"雲林縣","source":"雲林縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://law.yunlin.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL001115","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:37:02+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"c04d1fbe57f38e7edb41a88dc45fff69bb55729b67ade138a638c0724d0898b8","sourceRecordId":"雲林縣-GL001115","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"民國 113 年 09 月 06 日","effectiveDate":""}}